Aim:
To write a Python program to display all IP addresses of the system.

Algorithm:
1. Import the socket module.
2. Get the hostname.
3. Find all IP addresses using gethostbyname_ex().
4. Display all IP addresses.
Program:
import socket

host = socket.gethostname()
ip = socket.gethostbyname_ex(host)

print("Hostname:", host)
print("IP Addresses:")

for i in ip[2]:
    print(i)
